Feature: Book catalog search with SQLite # features/book_catalog_db.feature:1

  @db @smoke
  Scenario: Find an available book in the SQLite catalog        # features/book_catalog_db.feature:4
    Given the catalog contains "Clean Code" marked as available # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:19
    When I search for "Clean Code"                              # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:32
    Then I should find 1 result                                 # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:37
    And the result should be available                          # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:43

  @db @regression
  Scenario: Find an unavailable book in the SQLite catalog         # features/book_catalog_db.feature:11
    Given the catalog contains "Refactoring" marked as unavailable # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:19
    When I search for "Refactoring"                                # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:32
    Then I should find 1 result                                    # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:37
    And the result should be unavailable                           # features/steps/catalog_steps.py:43

